t before writing stdin; host enforcement is not supplied. Stderr is shipped to a diagnostics service whose readers must not receive LEDGER_TOKEN. This is a single-principal stdio component, not an HTTP server. Downstream response limits, credential revocation, host sandboxing and actual published-package provenance are outside scope.\nLaunch working directory is this package root; the host supplies LEDGER_TOKEN from its secret store.\n","numLines":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":5}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nxvb6Cf2jBXQS2TaK2XzVs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
